    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast and Cleaver</strong> is a <strong>2D open-world adventure </strong> where tactical combat and monster hunting define your journey. As the <strong>Hanging City's hired hunter</strong>, your mission is to track and defeat mythical creatures, uncover the secrets of their unique spawning conditions, and use their materials to strengthen both yourself and the city. Every successful hunt expands the <strong>Hanging City</strong>, unlocking new merchants, potions, and character customizations to aid your next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=610 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A World Shaped by the Hunt</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through <strong>six distinct biomes</strong>\u2014from the frozen peaks of the <strong>Snow Mountains</strong> to the infernal depths of <strong>The Flames</strong>\u2014each home to unique creatures with <strong>their own behaviors, weaknesses, and environmental triggers.</strong> Learning how and where to summon them is just as important as the fight itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fast-Paced Tactical Combat</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>quick, skill-based, and unforgiving.</strong> Use <strong>dashes, rolls, wall slides, and precise strikes</strong> to stay alive while taking down formidable foes like <strong>wyverns, gorgons, yetis, and other mythological beasts.</strong> Every battle requires careful positioning and mastery of movement to outmaneuver deadly attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Hanging City \u2013 Your Home &amp; Arsenal</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you hunt, the Hanging City evolves. Turn in rare materials and slay biome specific bosses to unlock <strong>new potions and merchants,</strong> making each hunt more efficient. This living, growing hub serves as your base of operations, rewarding your dedication with tons of character customization to look swaged out while battling the deadliest beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Survival Demands Strategy</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>grid-based inventory</strong>, balancing rare loot with essential quest goods. Sell excess materials, buy powerful potions, and customize your hunter\u2019s appearance by completing challenging\u00a0<strong>in-game achievements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=610 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Hunting:</strong> Explore <strong>six hand-crafted biomes</strong> filled with diverse creatures, hidden lore, and tactical combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat System:</strong> Every fight is a <strong>test of skill and movement</strong>, with fast-paced dodging and precise strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Spawning Mechanics:</strong> Learn <strong>unique environmental conditions</strong> to summon specific creatures and obtain rare materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hanging City Evolves:</strong> Strengthen your city by contributing materials, unlocking <strong>new shops, upgrades, and potions.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Unlock new <strong>hunter outfits and throwables\u00a0</strong>through <strong>in-game achievements</strong>\u2014no microtransactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hand-Holding, No Difficulty Modes:</strong> The <strong>challenge is biome-based</strong>, with each region offering new dangers to overcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to track, hunt, and carve your way through the world of <i>Beast and Cleaver</i>? Your city is counting on you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast and Cleaver</strong> is a <strong>2D open-world adventure </strong> where tactical combat and monster hunting define your journey. As the <strong>Hanging City's hired hunter</strong>, your mission is to track and defeat mythical creatures, uncover the secrets of their unique spawning conditions, and use their materials to strengthen both yourself and the city. Every successful hunt expands the <strong>Hanging City</strong>, unlocking new merchants, potions, and character customizations to aid your next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=610 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/3f5bae4f4f537204757cf66ef0b94cf0.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A World Shaped by the Hunt</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through <strong>six distinct biomes</strong>\u2014from the frozen peaks of the <strong>Snow Mountains</strong> to the infernal depths of <strong>The Flames</strong>\u2014each home to unique creatures with <strong>their own behaviors, weaknesses, and environmental triggers.</strong> Learning how and where to summon them is just as important as the fight itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/03d3335326ba450eabee2c233c86b60d.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fast-Paced Tactical Combat</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>quick, skill-based, and unforgiving.</strong> Use <strong>dashes, rolls, wall slides, and precise strikes</strong> to stay alive while taking down formidable foes like <strong>wyverns, gorgons, yetis, and other mythological beasts.</strong> Every battle requires careful positioning and mastery of movement to outmaneuver deadly attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/27bf00333d5824bcb4427c4fd3489925.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Hanging City \u2013 Your Home &amp; Arsenal</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you hunt, the Hanging City evolves. Turn in rare materials and slay biome specific bosses to unlock <strong>new potions and merchants,</strong> making each hunt more efficient. This living, growing hub serves as your base of operations, rewarding your dedication with tons of character customization to look swaged out while battling the deadliest beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=608 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/6cda68cb324916558d855a4bbaaddeb7.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Survival Demands Strategy</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>grid-based inventory</strong>, balancing rare loot with essential quest goods. Sell excess materials, buy powerful potions, and customize your hunter\u2019s appearance by completing challenging\u00a0<strong>in-game achievements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.poster.avif?t=1752582784\" width=610 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.webm?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568030/extras/96a8341a5912b3b6ec364336f36d0c3c.mp4?t=1752582784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Hunting:</strong> Explore <strong>six hand-crafted biomes</strong> filled with diverse creatures, hidden lore, and tactical combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat System:</strong> Every fight is a <strong>test of skill and movement</strong>, with fast-paced dodging and precise strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Spawning Mechanics:</strong> Learn <strong>unique environmental conditions</strong> to summon specific creatures and obtain rare materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hanging City Evolves:</strong> Strengthen your city by contributing materials, unlocking <strong>new shops, upgrades, and potions.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Unlock new <strong>hunter outfits and throwables\u00a0</strong>through <strong>in-game achievements</strong>\u2014no microtransactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hand-Holding, No Difficulty Modes:</strong> The <strong>challenge is biome-based</strong>, with each region offering new dangers to overcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to track, hunt, and carve your way through the world of <i>Beast and Cleaver</i>? Your city is counting on you.</p>",
